<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/$0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/$0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were weak-$0.50 lower. Demand light. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  55.50-56.50</p>
<p>liberal volume 56.00-56.50, few 57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: mostly steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-500 lbs.  41.00-45.00, few 46.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs.  45.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  47.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
</text>
